It is built field by field from the last one: `T ← concat_{d < a} (T + c·d mod Q)`.
Everything (`a_k`, `c_k`, the suffix volumes) is a literal of the code.

* `genP_spec`: the generator, linear cost `O(|A| · (vol A + 1) · (Bb + 2))`.
