  `Dl ax0 (g lay')` into `Dl ax0 lay'`.  `swapPos` and `KIL.swapMid` are `POp`s.
* `Dl_layA`: for the standard layout `layA ax` of an axis order `ax`, `Dl` is an ordinary pull
